# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF. Without this, a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true converts Go sources to CRLF, and gofmt then
# reports every file as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts and Go sources must stay LF so they run on Linux unchanged.
*.go text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary artifacts are never touched.
*.exe binary
*.png binary
